 comorb:["Coronary disease, PAD, COPD, hypertension"],
 signs:["AAA: usually none; pulsatile expansile mass above the umbilicus, back or abdominal ache, found on scan","Dissection: sudden severe tearing chest or back pain, unequal arm pulses or BP, neurological signs, syncope"],
