 compl:["Rupture and death, limb ischaemia, stroke, renal failure"],
 nurse:["Known AAA: surveillance ultrasound schedule, BP control, smoking cessation, know the rupture symptoms","Post-repair: graft infection signs, wound care, walking programme"],
