 signs:["Endocarditis: persistent fever, night sweats, weight loss, new or changed murmur, splinter haemorrhages, painful fingertip nodes, heart failure, stroke or emboli","Pericarditis: sharp central chest pain worse lying flat and on inspiration, better sitting forward, fever, pericardial rub"],
 red:["Fever with a murmur or prosthetic valve: blood cultures before antibiotics, urgent review","Pericarditis with breathlessness, hypotension, raised JVP, muffled heart sounds: tamponade, 000"],
